# GuitarFreaks 3rd Mix (GE949 VER. JAB), Konami 2000: the first boot, from the install CD (MAME's
# "install" disc, 949jac01: its rompath names it as the runtime disc for this step; HIRAKU: --cd
# install) with the install cassette in the slot (MAME: -cassette install; HIRAKU: --cassette
# install). It installs on its own, the onboard flash and then the PC Card: INFO 507 by frame
# ~15,000 (the Test press lands mid-install and changes nothing).
# Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game gtrfrk3m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 1500 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 24000 quit
